.TH "SCCFM-CLI OBJECTS UPDATE-DEFAULT" "1" "2026-06-02" "0.36.0" "sccfm-cli objects update-default Manual"
.SH NAME
sccfm-cli\-objects\-update-default \- Update the default content value of an...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sccfm-cli objects update-default
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update the default content value of an object, preserving all existing overrides.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-u,\fP \-\-uid TEXT
The unique identifier (UID) of the object.
.TP
\fB\-v,\fP \-\-value TEXT
The new default value (IP address, CIDR, range, or URL).  [required]
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fP [table|json]
Output format  [default: table]
.TP
\fB\-\-config\-path\fP PATH
Path to the configuration file (defaults to ~/.sccfm-cli/config.json).
